      <slug></slug>
      <title>OSCTool - learning C# and Mono by doing</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In 2007, the Oxford Supercomputing Centre received enough funding to put some infrastructure in place behind their clusters - but found a lack of adequate tools to manage it. This talk covers the progression from Perl-based prototyping to 25kloc of C#, due for GPL release in Q1 2010.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
